    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Various hazards that may cause personal injury or property damage and increase our operating costs, which may exceed the coverage of our insurance;</FONT></TD></TR>
