    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Common Shares outstanding</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Immediately before the offering</P></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">10,451,882 Common Shares</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
