    <TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Any decline in the availability
                                    or increase in the cost of raw materials could materially impact our earnings. See &ldquo;<I>Item
                                    3. Key Information &mdash;D. Risk Factors&mdash;Risks Related to Our Business and Industry&mdash;Any
                                    decline in the availability or increase in the cost of raw materials could materially impact our
                                    earnings</I>&rdquo; in our 2021 Annual Report.</P></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
