                                            U.S. broker-dealers may be discouraged from effecting transactions in our Common Shares because
                                            they may be considered penny stocks and thus be subject to the penny stock rules</I>&rdquo;
                                            in this prospectus.</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></P></TD></TR>
