    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">the date
                                    of determining the security holders entitled to the rights distribution;&nbsp;</P></TD></TR>
  <TR>
