    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">the
    extent to which the rights include an over-subscription privilege with respect to unsubscribed securities; and</FONT></TD></TR>

